1
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,670
Baik.

2
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:25,060
[Pasukan Xiang Sheng]

3
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:00,970
Biar saya sembelih!

4
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:04,230
Baik.

5
00:01:39,710 --> 00:01:41,069
Jadi haiwan baik dalam hayat ini,

6
00:01:41,070 --> 00:01:43,600
jadilah manusia baik pada hayat seterusnya!

7
00:01:55,070 --> 00:01:55,920
Dah siap sembelih.

8
00:01:55,921 --> 00:01:58,580
Ada banyak darah, tukar
besen lain untuk tadah.

9
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:38,740
[Pursuit of Jade]

10
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:41,550
[Episod 1]

11
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:45,469
Kita boleh mula makan sekejap lagi.

12
00:03:45,470 --> 00:03:46,590
Baik.

13
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,870
Tak tergesa-gesa.

14
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:53,799
Bukankah keluarga Fan baru
saja adakan majlis pengebumian?

15
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,239
Kenapa Puan Chen

16
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:58,240
ajak Changyu ini untuk
sembelih haiwan tahun baharu?

17
00:03:58,430 --> 00:04:00,290
Sebab kasihan akan budak itulah.

18
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:02,749
Suami isteri keluarga Fan itu
mati dibunuh penyamun gunung,

19
00:04:02,750 --> 00:04:04,210
tak tinggalkan harta pun,

20
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:06,560
tinggal dua orang anak perempuan saja.

21
00:04:06,630 --> 00:04:08,910
Nasib baik Changyu berguna.

22
00:04:09,710 --> 00:04:11,239
Dia ikut jejak langkah ayahnya,

23
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:13,469
menyembelih haiwan untuk menyara keluarga,

24
00:04:13,470 --> 00:04:15,430
berusaha menyara keluarga Fan.

25
00:04:15,870 --> 00:04:17,039
Kesiannya.

26
00:04:17,040 --> 00:04:19,268
Suami isteri keluarga Fan itu baik sangat,

27
00:04:19,269 --> 00:04:20,949
kenapa ditimpa kejadian ini pula?

28
00:04:20,950 --> 00:04:21,360
Nenek Kang.

29
00:04:21,361 --> 00:04:22,390
Cepat duduk.

30
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:24,930
Budak perempuan ini yang membawa malang.

31
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,160
Jangan mengarut.

32
00:04:26,161 --> 00:04:27,600
Saya pernah cakap dulu.

33
00:04:28,510 --> 00:04:31,000
Awak tengok maknya begitu cantik.

34
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:31,830
Mungkin

35
00:04:32,110 --> 00:04:33,509
dia daripada rumah pelacuran,

36
00:04:33,510 --> 00:04:37,770
kalau tidak, manalah dia kahwin dengan
Fan Erniu yang sebagai penyembelih?

37
00:04:42,070 --> 00:04:43,310
Aduhai,

38
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,799
hormatilah orang yang dah meninggal dunia.

39
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:46,060
Janganlah cakap lagi.

40
00:04:46,390 --> 00:04:47,590
Saya salah cakapkah?

41
00:04:48,600 --> 00:04:49,999
Walaupun rupanya macam maknya

42
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:51,570
cantik dan lemah lembut,

43
00:04:52,070 --> 00:04:53,600
tenaga dia itu

44
00:04:54,070 --> 00:04:55,120
tak macam gadis,

45
00:04:55,360 --> 00:04:56,600
jauh lebih kuat

46
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,070
daripada lelaki muda.

47
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,160
Memang kuat.

48
00:05:02,270 --> 00:05:03,270
Budak ini

49
00:05:03,310 --> 00:05:04,509
memang nasibnya malang.

50
00:05:04,510 --> 00:05:05,919
Bukan saya yang cakap begitu.

51
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:08,120
Dia dah bertunang dengan Song Yan, kan?

52
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,269
Keluarga Song pun

53
00:05:09,270 --> 00:05:10,870
pergi menilik nasib mereka.

54
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,800
Selepas ditilik,

55
00:05:13,120 --> 00:05:14,240
habislah.

56
00:05:14,600 --> 00:05:18,260
- Dia itu ditakdirkan hidup seorang diri.
- Tak pernah dengar pun.

57
00:05:18,830 --> 00:05:20,189
Keluarga Song pun tergesa-gesa

58
00:05:20,190 --> 00:05:21,160
batalkan pertunangan.

59
00:05:21,161 --> 00:05:22,220
Rupanya macam ini.

60
00:05:23,950 --> 00:05:24,950
Nenek Kang,

61
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:26,359
bagilah awak darah haiwan ini

62
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,760
untuk membuang nasib malang.
Awak...

63
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:31,550
Tengoklah dia, melampau betul.

64
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:33,390
Kotorlah badan saya.

65
00:05:33,391 --> 00:05:34,560
Puan Chen kata,

66
00:05:34,870 --> 00:05:35,929
separuh daripada daging yang disembelih
tadi untuk sambutan tahun baharu

67
00:05:35,930 --> 00:05:37,389
akan dikongsikan dengan para penduduk.

68
00:05:37,390 --> 00:05:39,190
Semua orang boleh datang pilih.

69
00:05:40,270 --> 00:05:41,270
Eh, awak...

70
00:05:41,750 --> 00:05:42,920
Cepat pergi.

71
00:05:44,630 --> 00:05:46,679
Apa yang salah dengan kata-kata saya?

72
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:48,750
Awak... awak memang pembawa malang.

73
00:05:49,190 --> 00:05:50,269
Awak bawa nasib malang
sampai mak ayah kamu mati!

74
00:05:50,270 --> 00:05:51,869
- Buat tunang awak batalkan pertunangan.
- Jangan cakap lagi.

75
00:05:51,870 --> 00:05:53,719
Adik perempuan awak dilahirkan
memang lemah dan selalu sakit,

76
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,919
itu pun sebab awak yang bawa nasib malang.

77
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,120
Sudahlah!
Tak, awak tengok dia.

78
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,760
Nenek Kang, haiwan untuk tahun baharu.

79
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,630
Janganlah berebut.

80
00:06:00,631 --> 00:06:03,390
Ini saya punya!

81
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,360
Adik Changyu,

82
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,850
ini upah sembelih haiwan hari ini.

83
00:06:23,920 --> 00:06:24,750
Terima kasih, Puan Chen.

84
00:06:24,751 --> 00:06:26,039
Kami dah nak mula makan,

85
00:06:26,040 --> 00:06:27,749
awak tinggallah makan bersama kami.

86
00:06:27,750 --> 00:06:28,750
Tak naklah.

87
00:06:29,270 --> 00:06:31,559
Keluarga saya baru saja siap
adakan upacara pengebumian.

88
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:34,269
Awak tak kisah, malah minta
saya untuk sembelih haiwan,

89
00:06:34,270 --> 00:06:35,530
itu pun dah cukup baik.

90
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,560
Baiklah.

91
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:40,119
Awak ambillah organ dalaman haiwan ini.

92
00:06:40,120 --> 00:06:41,180
Eh, seganlah saya.

93
00:06:41,830 --> 00:06:42,830
Awak ambil saja.

94
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:46,189
Dulu, ayah awak pandai
buat makanan menumis-reneh.

95
00:06:46,190 --> 00:06:48,790
Berikannya kepada awak
barulah tak membazir.

96
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,570
Bawa balik bagi Ning makan.

97
00:06:54,600 --> 00:06:55,600
Terima kasih.

98
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:57,559
Kalau begitu, saya balik dulu.

99
00:06:57,560 --> 00:06:59,360
Ning masih tunggu saya di rumah.

100
00:07:02,430 --> 00:07:03,430
Adik Changyu!

101
00:07:04,240 --> 00:07:05,120
Chongzhou sedang berperang,

102
00:07:05,121 --> 00:07:06,520
tempat kita pun tak aman.

103
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:09,310
Awak berhati-hati semasa balik.

104
00:07:09,750 --> 00:07:10,750
Jangan risau,

105
00:07:10,870 --> 00:07:12,629
saya dah tengok kalendar
almanak sebelum keluar,

106
00:07:12,630 --> 00:07:14,030
hari ini sangat bertuah.

107
00:07:20,510 --> 00:07:21,950
Baik sungguh gadis ini.

108
00:07:22,750 --> 00:07:23,750
Sayangnya,

109
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,600
malanglah nasibnya.

110
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:34,000
Empat, lima, enam.

111
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:37,190
Sepuluh, sebelas, dua belas.

112
00:07:37,630 --> 00:07:39,760
Empat belas, lima belas, lapan belas.

113
00:08:22,360 --> 00:08:23,360
Maaf mengganggu.

114
00:08:24,830 --> 00:08:27,070
Betul-betul maaf mengganggu.

115
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:30,480
Saya tak sengaja.

116
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,359
Jadi haiwan baik dalam hayat ini,

117
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,389
jadilah manusia baik pada hayat seterusnya.

118
00:08:33,390 --> 00:08:34,510
Saya tak sengaja.

119
00:08:34,909 --> 00:08:36,710
Wahai, Raja Syurga, Ratu Barat.

120
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:58,960
Dah tak bernafas?

121
00:09:01,320 --> 00:09:02,960
Hampir tak bernafas.

122
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:06,360
Changyu,

123
00:09:06,550 --> 00:09:07,550
balik.

124
00:09:12,390 --> 00:09:13,549
Tak boleh, keluarga saya miskin.

125
00:09:13,550 --> 00:09:14,510
Tak ada duit untuk selamatkan awak.

126
00:09:14,511 --> 00:09:15,739
Saya ada seorang adik di rumah.

127
00:09:15,740 --> 00:09:17,509
Macam mana kalau awak orang jahat?

128
00:09:17,510 --> 00:09:18,599
Changyu, jangan bersimpati.

129
00:09:18,600 --> 00:09:21,720
Baliklah!

130
00:09:22,270 --> 00:09:23,930
Saya datang selamatkan awak!

131
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,200
Awak jangan mati!

132
00:09:28,770 --> 00:09:29,770
Awak jangan mati!

133
00:09:31,630 --> 00:09:32,690
Jangan, tak apa...

134
00:09:38,080 --> 00:09:39,479
Jadi haiwan baik pada hayat ini,

135
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:42,010
jadilah manusia baik pada hayat seterusnya.

136
00:09:56,080 --> 00:09:57,080
Mak...

137
00:10:06,320 --> 00:10:08,850
Pastinya mak yang mahu
saya selamatkan awak.

138
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,660
Awak bertahanlah.

139
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,000
Jangan mati.

140
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Mak saya mahu saya selamatkan awak.

141
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,200
Ning!

142
00:10:41,080 --> 00:10:42,549
Ning, buka pintu!

143
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:43,550
Kakak!

144
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:46,319
Hari ini, saya pergi ke pekan
untuk tengok wayang kulit,

145
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,650
cerita tentang seorang panglima wanita.

146
00:10:49,390 --> 00:10:50,030
Kakak.

147
00:10:50,031 --> 00:10:51,290
Tolong angkat barang.

148
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,360
Changyu!

149
00:11:01,510 --> 00:11:02,510
Siapa dia?

150
00:11:02,750 --> 00:11:03,909
Saya jumpa dia di jalan,

151
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:04,910
dia masih bernafas.

152
00:11:04,911 --> 00:11:06,959
Mak cik, tolong saya papah
dia masuk ke dalam rumah.

153
00:11:06,960 --> 00:11:07,960
Ini...

154
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:09,319
Awak tak tahu dia orang baik atau jahat,

155
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:10,999
berani awak bawa dia balik ke rumah.

156
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,389
Dia seorang lelaki lagi.

157
00:11:12,390 --> 00:11:13,910
Awak ini belum kahwin,

158
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:16,749
nanti orang lain pasti
kritik awak dengan teruk.

159
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:18,669
Sepanjang jalan ini,
tiada orang nampak, kan?

160
00:11:18,670 --> 00:11:20,200
Saya tengok kecederaan dia

161
00:11:20,390 --> 00:11:21,959
lebih kurang sama macam emak ayah saya,

162
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:24,220
mesti dia dicederakan penyamun gunung.

163
00:11:25,480 --> 00:11:27,540
Saya tak boleh fikir banyak-banyak.

164
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:29,530
Bawa dia ke rumah saya.

165
00:11:29,960 --> 00:11:31,479
Tak boleh bawa nasib malang
kepada keluarga mak cik.

166
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,750
Kalau dia mati...

167
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:35,200
Sama ada dia mati di luar

168
00:11:35,201 --> 00:11:36,269
atau mati di rumah saya.

169
00:11:36,270 --> 00:11:37,270
Jalan.

170
00:11:38,120 --> 00:11:39,120
Jalanlah!

171
00:11:43,270 --> 00:11:45,509
Pak cik awak pergi ke perhentian
pekan untuk uruskan hal.

172
00:11:45,510 --> 00:11:46,549
Saya kena pergi tarik dia balik,

173
00:11:46,550 --> 00:11:47,909
awak tengokkan dia dulu.

174
00:11:47,910 --> 00:11:48,440
Ning,

175
00:11:48,670 --> 00:11:49,670
awak mari sini.

176
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:51,149
Awak pun kena menjaga di sini.

177
00:11:51,150 --> 00:11:54,550
Lelaki dan perempuan tak boleh
berduaan di dalam satu bilik.

178
00:11:54,720 --> 00:11:55,920
Cepat saja mak cik balik.
Baik.

179
00:12:20,270 --> 00:12:21,670
Kenapa banyak berdarah?

180
00:12:23,510 --> 00:12:24,749
Sebelum pak cik balik,

181
00:12:24,750 --> 00:12:26,030
awak jangan mati.

182
00:12:28,030 --> 00:12:30,630
Saya pernah ikut pak
cik keluar merawat orang.

183
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:34,400
Nampaknya kena cuba nasib saja.

184
00:12:34,550 --> 00:12:36,389
Ning, pergi ambil semangkuk air panas.

185
00:12:36,390 --> 00:12:37,320
Mak cik dah cakap,

186
00:12:37,321 --> 00:12:39,149
lelaki dan perempuan tak boleh
berduaan di dalam satu bilik.

187
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:40,199
Saya kena menjaga di sini.

188
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,389
Apa lelaki dan perempuan lagi?

189
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,749
Dia hampir jadi hantu.

190
00:12:42,750 --> 00:12:43,750
Cepat pergi!

191
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:58,100
Sebelum ini, taruh sebanyak ini,

192
00:12:58,910 --> 00:13:01,770
tapi pendarahan sebelum
ini tak sebanyak kali ini.

193
00:13:03,390 --> 00:13:04,390
Taruhlah semua.

194
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:19,210
Apa yang berlaku ini, Changyu?

195
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,480
Dia...

196
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:27,750
Awak buat apa ini?

197
00:13:27,790 --> 00:13:28,920
Bagi dia minum ubat.

198
00:13:29,720 --> 00:13:30,270
Awak...

199
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,669
Aduhai!

200
00:13:31,670 --> 00:13:34,029
Awak taruh satu bungkus ubat saya itu?

201
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:36,439
Awak nak selamatkan dia atau nak bunuh dia?

202
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:38,670
Awak buat apa ini, budak?

203
00:13:40,270 --> 00:13:41,270
Saya fikir

204
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:43,079
pendarahan kali itu tak sebanyak kali ini,

205
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,740
jadi saya taruh lebih banyak.

206
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,630
Masa itu keldai!

207
00:13:48,030 --> 00:13:48,750
Keldai!

208
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:50,710
Keldai sama dengan manusiakah?

209
00:13:51,320 --> 00:13:53,239
Kalau dia minum ubat ini,

210
00:13:53,240 --> 00:13:54,240
jangan katakan manusia,

211
00:13:54,241 --> 00:13:56,630
keldai besar pun akan mati terus.

212
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,480
Awak jerit-jerit apa ini?

213
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,150
Saya cuma nak selamatkan dia,

214
00:14:02,670 --> 00:14:04,630
tak nak dia mati di rumah awak.

215
00:14:04,870 --> 00:14:06,870
Jadi, saya taruh lebih banyak ubat.

216
00:14:07,030 --> 00:14:08,319
Makan banyak pun boleh mati kekenyangan.

217
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,749
Kenapa awak tak makan banyak-banyak?

218
00:14:09,750 --> 00:14:11,680
Makan pun boleh mati kekenyangan?

219
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,360
Sudahlah.

220
00:14:13,510 --> 00:14:14,910
Kamu berdua keluar dulu.

221
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:16,720
Gadis tunggu di luar.

222
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:27,839
Changyu sendiri pun dah
tiada duit nak beli makanan.

223
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:29,509
Kenapa bawa balik orang sembarangan lagi?

224
00:14:29,510 --> 00:14:31,360
Kenapa awak tak halang dia pun?

225
00:14:32,790 --> 00:14:33,999
Awak tengoklah mukanya,

226
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:34,910
awak akan tahu sebabnya.

227
00:14:34,911 --> 00:14:36,079
Macam mana saya nak halang dia?

228
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,630
Apa gunanya kacak?

229
00:14:37,910 --> 00:14:39,390
Tak dapat cari makan pun.

230
00:14:53,240 --> 00:14:55,480
Abang ini kacak sangat.

231
00:14:55,630 --> 00:14:57,840
Sebab itulah kakak bawa dia balik.

232
00:14:58,670 --> 00:14:59,670
Mengarut.

233
00:14:59,790 --> 00:15:01,390
Kakak selamatkan nyawanya.

234
00:15:01,670 --> 00:15:03,200
Apa kaitannya dengan rupa?

235
00:15:37,510 --> 00:15:40,370
Peninjau menjejaki dari
Chongzhou sampai ke sini.

236
00:15:40,390 --> 00:15:42,190
Kesan darah juga hilang di sini.

237
00:15:42,630 --> 00:15:43,959
Salji dah turun sehari semalam,

238
00:15:43,960 --> 00:15:45,560
jejak kaki pun dah ditutupi.

239
00:15:46,750 --> 00:15:48,000
Sini Jizhou,

240
00:15:48,001 --> 00:15:52,170
[Wei Sheng]

241
00:15:48,200 --> 00:15:49,790
wilayah He Jingyuan.

242
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:52,480
Kita tak boleh meronda sesuka hati.

243
00:15:52,550 --> 00:15:54,839
Laporkan kepada pihak ibu kota,
tunggu keputusan perdana menteri.

244
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,840
Baliklah.
Baik.

245
00:15:56,010 --> 00:15:57,010
Ya.

246
00:16:05,510 --> 00:16:09,240
[Kedai Tauhu Angin Musim Bunga]

247
00:16:17,690 --> 00:16:24,359
[Lorong Xigu]

248
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:25,420
Changyu dah balik.

249
00:16:26,200 --> 00:16:27,200
Changyu.

250
00:16:29,790 --> 00:16:30,790
Changyu.

251
00:16:30,791 --> 00:16:32,320
Changyu, tunggu sebentar.

252
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:37,910
Changyu.

253
00:16:40,360 --> 00:16:41,839
Dah setengah bulan kita tak berjumpa,

254
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:44,670
awak semakin cantik.

255
00:16:46,440 --> 00:16:47,440
Ini...

256
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:51,390
Awak baru beli ubat untuk Ning?

257
00:16:51,600 --> 00:16:52,360
Saya ada...

258
00:16:52,361 --> 00:16:54,160
Kalau ada apa-apa, cakap terus.

259
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:56,630
Saya cuma terfikir,

260
00:16:57,120 --> 00:16:58,669
pertunangan antara keluarga kita berdua

261
00:16:58,670 --> 00:17:00,150
dah dibatalkan,

262
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:03,509
awak simpan surat pertunangan
itu pun tiada gunanya.

263
00:17:03,510 --> 00:17:06,310
- Apa kata...
- Nak minta balik surat pertunangan?

264
00:17:06,829 --> 00:17:07,829
Boleh.

265
00:17:08,240 --> 00:17:09,719
Kita langsaikan hutang dulu.

266
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:12,400
Yuran pengajian Song Yan yang saya bayar

267
00:17:13,109 --> 00:17:15,509
dan juga bantuan kepada
kamu anak-beranak selama ini,

268
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:16,828
bayarlah hutang ini dulu,

269
00:17:16,829 --> 00:17:18,549
mesti saya pulangkan surat pertunangan.

270
00:17:18,550 --> 00:17:21,399
Awak tak boleh salahkan keluarga
Song kerana batalkan pertunangan ini,

271
00:17:21,400 --> 00:17:24,000
tukang tilik itu yang
kata nasib awak tak baik.

272
00:17:24,109 --> 00:17:25,509
Takkan nak Yan

273
00:17:25,510 --> 00:17:28,108
kahwin dengan perempuan
yang bawa malang kepada suami?

274
00:17:28,109 --> 00:17:29,639
Cakap pasal hutang,

275
00:17:29,640 --> 00:17:31,549
itu hutang kami dengan mak ayah awak,

276
00:17:31,550 --> 00:17:32,960
bukan dengan awak pun.

277
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:35,269
Surat pertunangan itu pun ayah
saya yang menandatangani dengan awak.

278
00:17:35,270 --> 00:17:37,200
Awak turun dan minta daripada dia.

279
00:17:37,790 --> 00:17:38,850
Budak tak guna ini!

280
00:17:39,480 --> 00:17:40,480
Awak berhenti!
Mak.

281
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,070
Mak jangan marah.

282
00:17:50,110 --> 00:17:51,710
Bagi sesetengah perkara...

283
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:55,700
Lebih baik saya jelaskan kepadanya.

284
00:17:57,750 --> 00:17:59,000
Yan,

285
00:17:59,270 --> 00:18:00,720
perempuan jahat ini

286
00:18:00,830 --> 00:18:02,830
cuma tamakkan kemasyhuran awak.

287
00:18:03,110 --> 00:18:05,749
Dia tahu awak baik hati dan mudah dipujuk,

288
00:18:05,750 --> 00:18:07,549
sebab itulah dia tak nak lepaskan awak.

289
00:18:07,550 --> 00:18:10,610
Dia sengaja sebut budi
mereka untuk menuntut balasan.

290
00:18:12,240 --> 00:18:13,936
Beberapa hari lagi,
- Sebut budi... - Tuan majistret

291
00:18:13,960 --> 00:18:15,199
akan datang jemput kami pindah rumah.

292
00:18:15,200 --> 00:18:16,376
Menuntut balasan?
- Sampai masa itu... - Mak.

293
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:18,460
- Habislah dia! - Masuk ke rumah dulu.

294
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,480
Yu.

295
00:18:29,000 --> 00:18:31,860
Saya, Song Yan bukan orang
yang tak mengenang budi.

296
00:18:32,150 --> 00:18:34,879
Saya akan sentiasa ingat
budi baik keluarga Fan.

297
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,549
Namun antara segala kebaikan,
berbakti kepada ibu bapa diutamakan.

298
00:18:36,550 --> 00:18:38,589
Kalau saya ingkar arahan mak
dan tetap nak kahwini awak,

299
00:18:38,590 --> 00:18:41,190
saya akan jadi anak
derhaka yang tak berbakti.

300
00:18:42,110 --> 00:18:43,549
Walaupun kita tak boleh jadi suami isteri,

301
00:18:43,550 --> 00:18:45,159
kita masih boleh jadi abang dan adik.

302
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:46,750
Kata-kata awak tadi,

303
00:18:47,070 --> 00:18:48,239
saya anggap awak merajuk saja,

304
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,349
saya takkan simpan dalam hati.

305
00:18:49,350 --> 00:18:50,350
Jangan.

306
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:53,269
Awak mesti simpan kata-kata ini dalam hati.

307
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:55,400
Tak perlulah kita jadi abang dan adik.

308
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:58,509
Adik-beradik kandung pun
kena kira hutang dengan jelas.

309
00:18:58,510 --> 00:18:59,920
Saya paling benci

310
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:02,880
orang yang mengumpat di belakang,

311
00:19:03,590 --> 00:19:05,879
sebarkan khabar angin
bahawa saya pembawa malang,

312
00:19:05,880 --> 00:19:07,879
kata keluarga saya nak menuntut balasan,

313
00:19:07,880 --> 00:19:10,210
rasa saya nak paksa Song Yan kahwini saya.

314
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,109
Semua ini dikatakan orang lain.

315
00:19:12,110 --> 00:19:13,309
Apa kaitan dengan dengan kami?

316
00:19:13,310 --> 00:19:14,829
Saya tak kata pun awak yang cakap.

317
00:19:14,830 --> 00:19:16,879
Kenapa awak cepat-cepat nak mengaku?

318
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,010
- Budak jahat! - Mak!

319
00:19:18,200 --> 00:19:18,790
Yu,

320
00:19:19,200 --> 00:19:20,999
saya tak kisah fikiran orang luar,

321
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,919
tapi perasaan saya
terhadap awak selama ini,

322
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:24,789
takkan hanya boleh dinilai dengan duit?

323
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:27,190
Betul, memang hanya boleh dinilai begitu.

324
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:31,309
Kamu bayar hutang, saya akan
pulangkan surat pertunangan.

325
00:19:31,310 --> 00:19:33,999
Jangan gunakan pasal persahabatan
atau perasaan untuk buat saya rasa jijik.

326
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:36,069
Dua ekor haiwan yang saya bela
itu pun lebih baik daripada kamu.

327
00:19:36,070 --> 00:19:37,070
Kamu berdua

328
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,440
memang tak mengenang budi.

329
00:19:41,200 --> 00:19:42,510
Awak cakap apa ini?

330
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,350
Budak jahat ini,

331
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,999
jaga sikit percakapan awak!

332
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,239
- Awaklah haiwan! - Mak.

333
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,829
- Sekeluarga awak haiwan! - Mak.

334
00:19:48,830 --> 00:19:50,789
Padanlah muka awak jadi penyembelih haiwan.

335
00:19:50,790 --> 00:19:52,160
Apalah dia ini?

336
00:19:53,750 --> 00:19:55,480
Pepatah lama memang tak silap,

337
00:19:55,880 --> 00:19:57,269
berbelanja untuk lelaki,

338
00:19:57,270 --> 00:19:58,350
mesti dilaknat.

339
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:01,450
Ada lelaki yang berbaring
di rumah awak lagi!

340
00:20:02,920 --> 00:20:04,380
Mak cik mengejutkan saya.

341
00:20:07,110 --> 00:20:08,110
Nah.

342
00:20:08,510 --> 00:20:09,999
"Ubat dilaknat" awak ini

343
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,110
mesti mahal, kan?

344
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,480
Changyu.

345
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:16,920
Lelaki muda itu dah bangun,

346
00:20:16,921 --> 00:20:18,520
cepat awak pergi tengok dia.

347
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:20,000
Benar?

348
00:20:20,960 --> 00:20:22,620
Saya ingatkan dia pasti mati.

349
00:20:23,030 --> 00:20:24,440
Pak cik hebat betul.

350
00:20:24,590 --> 00:20:27,850
Boleh merawat apa-apa saja,
tak kira manusia atau haiwan.

351
00:20:30,550 --> 00:20:31,550
Dia ini puji saya

352
00:20:31,551 --> 00:20:32,680
atau memerahi saya?

353
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:42,000
Awak dah sedar?

354
00:21:09,830 --> 00:21:10,830
Saya...

355
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:13,029
Saya nampak awak pengsan dalam salji,

356
00:21:13,030 --> 00:21:14,890
baru saya mengendong awak balik.

357
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:17,069
Namun yang betul-betul
selamatkan nyawa awak

358
00:21:17,070 --> 00:21:18,070
ialah Pak Zhao.

359
00:21:20,920 --> 00:21:22,920
Dia yang tukar baju untuk awak juga.

360
00:21:25,830 --> 00:21:26,830
Ini rumah dia.

361
00:21:28,750 --> 00:21:29,880
Dia seorang tabib

362
00:21:30,200 --> 00:21:31,860
yang merawat baghal dan kuda.

363
00:21:33,480 --> 00:21:35,680
Sudah tentu, dia juga merawat manusia.

364
00:21:41,200 --> 00:21:42,200
Terima kasih.

365
00:21:44,400 --> 00:21:46,200
Semasa awak gendong saya balik,

366
00:21:47,030 --> 00:21:48,749
awak ada nampak orang lain tak?

367
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:49,750
Orang lain?

368
00:21:51,510 --> 00:21:52,959
Nampak awak seorang saja.

369
00:21:52,960 --> 00:21:56,290
Ada orang lain yang terkubur
di dalam lubang salji itu juga?

370
00:22:11,880 --> 00:22:13,880
Saya pergi tuangkan air untuk awak.

371
00:22:14,880 --> 00:22:15,880
Nah.

372
00:22:19,070 --> 00:22:20,440
Apa tempat ini?

373
00:22:23,270 --> 00:22:26,000
Ini Lorong Xigu, Pekan
Lin'an, daerah Qingping.

374
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:29,159
Saya tengok awak tak macam orang tempatan.

375
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,160
Awak orang mana?

376
00:22:30,480 --> 00:22:31,310
Siapa nama awak?

377
00:22:31,311 --> 00:22:33,970
Adakah awak dicederakan
oleh penyamun gunung?

378
00:22:38,160 --> 00:22:39,360
Saya ialah Yan Zheng.

379
00:22:40,590 --> 00:22:42,320
Yan yang bawa maksud "bahasa",

380
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:44,440
Zheng yang bawa maksud "keadilan".

381
00:22:44,590 --> 00:22:47,400
Saya melarikan diri dari Chongzhou ke sini.

382
00:22:51,240 --> 00:22:53,840
Kalau begitu, awak ada
saudara-mara lain tak?

383
00:23:15,750 --> 00:23:17,610
Jie Ran Er. (Makna: Seorang diri)

384
00:23:18,400 --> 00:23:19,440
Jie Ran Er?

385
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:22,690
Nama keluarganya bukan "Yan"?

386
00:23:23,160 --> 00:23:24,220
Dia ayah tiri awak?

387
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:29,720
Maksud saya,

388
00:23:30,030 --> 00:23:32,430
tinggal saya seorang saja dalam keluarga.

389
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:35,720
Maaf.

390
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,880
Patutlah semasa saya selamatkan awak,

391
00:23:39,110 --> 00:23:40,790
awak asyik sebut mak.

392
00:23:56,310 --> 00:23:57,310
Pak cik!

393
00:23:57,680 --> 00:23:58,590
Kenapa?

394
00:23:58,591 --> 00:24:00,120
Kenapa batuk teruk sangat?

395
00:24:00,510 --> 00:24:02,286
Saya tak tahu.
Saya cuma sebut tentang maknya,

396
00:24:02,310 --> 00:24:03,549
dia terus batuk.

397
00:24:03,550 --> 00:24:05,480
Kenapa awak sebut tentang maknya?

398
00:24:05,590 --> 00:24:08,029
Pesakit tak boleh dirangsang pada masa ini.

399
00:24:08,030 --> 00:24:09,070
Makku.

400
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:10,940
Kenapa pak cik sebut lagi?

401
00:24:13,590 --> 00:24:14,440
Pak cik tengoklah.

402
00:24:14,441 --> 00:24:16,200
Cepat, bagi dia baring.

403
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:20,480
Yan Zheng...

404
00:24:21,000 --> 00:24:22,000
Yan Zheng...

405
00:24:22,400 --> 00:24:23,400
Yan Zheng...

406
00:24:24,450 --> 00:24:26,309
[Yan]

407
00:24:26,310 --> 00:24:28,710
Kalau dia mati sebab saya banyak bertanya,

408
00:24:28,750 --> 00:24:29,750
macam mana itu?

409
00:24:30,720 --> 00:24:32,510
Keranda nipis pun mahal.

410
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:35,240
Apa kata

411
00:24:35,790 --> 00:24:37,749
terus gali lubang dan tanamnya saja?

412
00:24:37,750 --> 00:24:38,750
Kakak,

413
00:24:38,790 --> 00:24:41,160
patutkah kita tanya tuhan?

414
00:24:42,790 --> 00:24:43,790
Boleh juga.

415
00:24:44,440 --> 00:24:46,440
Biar tuhan yang tentukan semuanya.

416
00:24:46,590 --> 00:24:48,320
Mari kita lawan dengan rumput.

417
00:24:50,880 --> 00:24:53,159
Kalau rumput saya putus, kita beli keranda.

418
00:24:53,160 --> 00:24:54,829
Kalau rumput awak putus, kita gali lubang.

419
00:24:54,830 --> 00:24:55,830
Baik.

420
00:25:01,030 --> 00:25:03,090
Siapa menang dua kali dikira menang.

421
00:25:05,350 --> 00:25:06,789
Takkan lebih daripada tiga kali.

422
00:25:06,790 --> 00:25:07,790
Sekali lagi.

423
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:12,199
Tuhan dah kata tiga kali,

424
00:25:12,200 --> 00:25:13,310
beli keranda.

425
00:25:13,790 --> 00:25:15,450
Dompet saya kata sekali saja.

426
00:25:17,350 --> 00:25:18,350
Gali lubang.

427
00:25:29,110 --> 00:25:30,110
Pak cik.

428
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:32,469
Kalau tak dapat selamatkan
dia, jangan salahkan diri sendiri.

429
00:25:32,470 --> 00:25:33,680
Itu nasib dirinya.

430
00:25:36,790 --> 00:25:37,790
Apa benda ini?

431
00:25:39,160 --> 00:25:40,639
Kakak saya kedekut.

432
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:44,070
Tuhan suruh dia beli
keranda untuk abang kacak itu,

433
00:25:44,160 --> 00:25:46,069
dia berkeras nak gali
lubang untuk menipu tuhan.

434
00:25:46,070 --> 00:25:47,400
Saya tak tipu pun.

435
00:25:47,640 --> 00:25:49,049
Saya siap tulis papan kubur untuk dia lagi.

436
00:25:49,050 --> 00:25:50,460
Tengok, Yan Zheng.

437
00:25:51,220 --> 00:25:51,900
Nasib baik

438
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:54,490
saya tahu tulis kedua-dua perkataan ini.

439
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:58,590
Cepat buang semua benda malang ini!

440
00:25:58,920 --> 00:26:01,030
Badan lelaki muda itu kuat.

441
00:26:02,030 --> 00:26:03,239
Tambahan pula semalam,

442
00:26:03,240 --> 00:26:05,159
awak bagi dia minum
ubat hentikan pendarahan.

443
00:26:05,160 --> 00:26:06,719
Dia batuk sampai darah beku terkeluar.

444
00:26:06,720 --> 00:26:08,350
Nyawanya dah diselamatkan.

445
00:26:08,680 --> 00:26:09,960
Baguslah macam itu!

446
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:14,030
Dah diselamatkan!

447
00:26:14,110 --> 00:26:15,879
Kamu berdua jangan gembira awal sangat.

448
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:17,280
Bayaran ubat selepas ini

449
00:26:17,350 --> 00:26:19,350
jauh lebih mahal daripada keranda.

450
00:26:19,960 --> 00:26:20,960
Ning.

451
00:26:21,880 --> 00:26:22,640
Malam ini kita makan mi,

452
00:26:22,641 --> 00:26:23,700
awak pergi ke dapur

453
00:26:23,960 --> 00:26:25,639
ambilkan mak cik separuh besen kuah kicap.

454
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:26,640
Baik.

455
00:26:29,680 --> 00:26:31,240
Changyu, mari sini.

456
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:36,110
Apa yang awak fikirkan?

457
00:26:37,680 --> 00:26:39,309
Badan Ning selalu tak sihat,

458
00:26:39,310 --> 00:26:40,499
dia tengah makan ubat ini.

459
00:26:40,500 --> 00:26:42,430
Mana awak ada duit untuk rawat dia?

460
00:26:42,960 --> 00:26:44,070
Lelaki muda ini

461
00:26:44,350 --> 00:26:46,070
ada saudara-mara lagi tak?

462
00:26:47,030 --> 00:26:48,490
Jie Ran Er. (Seorang diri)

463
00:26:49,550 --> 00:26:50,550
Apa itu?

464
00:26:52,510 --> 00:26:54,239
Katanya semua ahli keluarganya dah mati,

465
00:26:54,240 --> 00:26:55,700
tinggal dia seorang saja.

466
00:26:55,790 --> 00:26:57,650
Dia larikan diri dari Chongzhou.

467
00:26:57,750 --> 00:27:00,509
Apabila sampai di persimpangan, dia
terserempak dengan penyamun gunung.

468
00:27:00,510 --> 00:27:01,510
Sekarang,

469
00:27:02,400 --> 00:27:04,589
rasanya dia tak ada
tempat yang boleh pergi.

470
00:27:04,590 --> 00:27:05,680
Kalau begitu,

471
00:27:05,920 --> 00:27:07,439
dia ada bawa duit

472
00:27:07,440 --> 00:27:08,959
atau surat kebenaran perjalanan?

473
00:27:08,960 --> 00:27:10,109
Semasa saya tolong dia tukar baju,

474
00:27:10,110 --> 00:27:12,230
saya dah meraba-raba seluruh badannya,
tiada duit pun.

475
00:27:12,390 --> 00:27:13,390
Sama ada

476
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:15,589
dah dirompak oleh perompak gunung

477
00:27:15,590 --> 00:27:17,400
ataupun dia memang miskin.

478
00:27:21,350 --> 00:27:23,439
Apa kata kita angkat dia ke
pintu balai majistret daerah,

479
00:27:23,440 --> 00:27:25,500
biar pegawai-pegawai yang uruskan.

480
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:26,240
Tak boleh.

481
00:27:26,510 --> 00:27:28,269
Ramai pengemis yang terbaring
di depan balai majistret daerah,

482
00:27:28,270 --> 00:27:29,679
awak pernah nampak mereka pedulikan?

483
00:27:29,680 --> 00:27:30,680
Betul juga.

484
00:27:31,110 --> 00:27:33,399
Kalau dia dah mati, boleh
diuruskan macam mana pun.

485
